*.c10 binary
*.tf10 binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.pdf binary
*.gz binary
*.zip binary
*.wasm binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
